    "name": "names-styles-budget-and-confirmed-tokens",
    "description": "proposeNames builds the same names in both engines from stored catalog evidence only: short, descriptive and date-first styles, a character budget, a person token only for a user-named person with a current compatible face or a user observation (Alex's incompatible face, an automatic observation, an unknown-flagged Mira, an excluded Zoe and 'Person 4' stay out), an event token only from a user-edited event, and the _2/_3 bump for a name already in the folder or claimed earlier in the batch. Nothing on disk or in the catalog changes.",
