  {
    "name": "names-companions-share-one-stem",
    "description": "proposeNames keeps companions on one stem: a RAW+JPEG pair with its .xmp, and a Live Photo HEIC+MOV, come back together, leader first (the image with the best evidence), each member with its own extension and evidenceID '<reason>|group:<leader fileID>'. A companion on disk but not in the catalog holds the whole group (unscannedCompanion). Names taken in the folder bump every member together (_2); when no shared bump is free for one member the whole group keeps its names (collision). A lone RAW and hidden tag sidecars are not grouped. renameFiles applies and undoes the group in one batch.",
